, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "A music video for the short version of Mr. Children's song \"Joutoku.\"", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 5}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Achromatic", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 104867, "title": {"romaji": "COCOLORS", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "There is a world in which an endless rain of dark ash fills the sky, and covers the earth. Humanity, fearing the ash that burns and melts away human flesh, had no choice but to cover themselves in protective suits, and their faces with gigantic masks. Bundled up in their suits and hidden away behind their masks, the people have fled deep within the underground. This is the story of the children growing up in this fearful world, this is \"COCOLORS\".\n<br><br>\n(Source: Kamikaze Douga)", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 2}, "endDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 2}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 45, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#COCOLORS", "genres": ["Adventure", "Drama", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Survival", "rank": 90, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tragedy", "rank": 88, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Post-Apocalyptic", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "CGI", "rank": 70, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Dystopian", "rank": 53, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Disability", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 104930, "title": {"romaji": "Kimi no Iru Basho", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "In the distant future a girl was used to recreate a lost city in virtual space. Due to being hospitalized for an incurable disease, Sachi becomes lonely but still falls in love with a boy, Ryou, who goes to school as she watches from her hospital window. She's co